      "postDate": "2026-08-11T00:18:51.970Z",
      "rawMarkdown": "Hi @thibautgoldsborough ,\n\nCould you please clarify whether the publicly available Zebrahub imaging and tracking data can be used as external training data for this competition?\n\nZebrahub imaging data:\nhttps://zebrahub.sf.czbiohub.org/imaging\n\nSpecifically, I'd like to confirm whether both the imaging data and the tracking annotations (*_tracks.csv) are allowed.\n\nThanks!",
      "content": "<p>Hi <a href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/thibautgoldsborough\" target=\"_blank\">@thibautgoldsborough</a> ,</p>\n<p>Could you please clarify whether the publicly available Zebrahub imaging and tracking data can be used as external training data for this competition?</p>\n<p>Zebrahub imaging data:\n<a href=\"https://zebrahub.sf.czbiohub.org/imaging\" target=\"_blank\">https://zebrahub.sf.czbiohub.org/imaging</a></p>\n<p>Specifically, I'd like to confirm whether both the imaging data and the tracking annotations (*_tracks.csv) are allowed.</p>\n<p>Thanks!</p>",
